@startuml
title Device Integration – Clientseite über bestehende WebAPI

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Bestehender Client – unverändert" {
    class TreeNodeBasedClient
}

package "TreeNodeBased.WebAPI" {
    class TreeNodeBasedDevicesController <<bestehend>>

    class "MediatR RequestHandler" as RequestHandlers {
        GetDevicesListRequestHandler
        GetNodeInfoRequestHandler
        GetValueRequestHandler
        SetValueRequestHandler
        CallNodeMethodRequestHandler
        SubscribeNodeValueRequestHandler
        UnsubscribeNodeValueRequestHandler
    }

    class WebApiDeviceIntegrationMapper {
        +MapDevice(...)
        +MapNodeInfo(...)
        +MapNodeValue(...)
        +MapMethodResult(...)
    }

    class Startup {
        +ConfigureContainer(builder)
    }
}

package "DeviceIntegrationPlugin.Client.Contracts" {
    interface IDeviceIntegrationService {
        +GetDevices(request, context)
        +GetNodeInfo(request, context)
        +GetTreePathInfo(request, context)
        +ReadValue(request, context)
        +WriteValue(request, context)
        +ExecuteCommand(request, context)
        +SubscribeNodeValueChanges(request, context)
        +UnsubscribeNodeValueChanges(request, context)
    }

    class DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy <<SmartProxy>>

    DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy ..|> IDeviceIntegrationService
}

package "DeviceIntegrationPlugin" {
    class DeviceIntegrationService <<gRPC-Service>>

    interface IIntegrationDeviceCatalog {
        +GetAvailableDevices()
        +GetDevice(deviceId)
        +IsDeviceAvailable(deviceId)
    }

    class DeviceIntegrationJobTransmitters {
        +GetNodeInfo
        +GetTreePathInfo
        +ReadValue
        +WriteValue
        +ExecuteCommand
        +SubscribeNodeValueChanges
        +UnsubscribeNodeValueChanges
    }
}

package "ServiceForwardRouter" {
    interface IJobFacade
    interface "IJobTransmitter<TRequest,TResult>" as IJobTransmitter
}

TreeNodeBasedClient --> TreeNodeBasedDevicesController : HTTP
TreeNodeBasedDevicesController --> RequestHandlers : MediatR

RequestHandlers --> IDeviceIntegrationService
RequestHandlers --> WebApiDeviceIntegrationMapper

Startup ..> DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy : registriert
Startup ..> IDeviceIntegrationService : Proxy als Implementierung

DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy --> DeviceIntegrationService : gRPC
DeviceIntegrationService ..|> IDeviceIntegrationService

DeviceIntegrationService --> IIntegrationDeviceCatalog
DeviceIntegrationService --> IJobFacade
DeviceIntegrationService --> DeviceIntegrationJobTransmitters

DeviceIntegrationJobTransmitters o--> IJobTransmitter

note bottom of TreeNodeBasedClient
  Keine Änderung am bestehenden Client.
  HTTP-Routen und Response-Modelle bleiben erhalten.
end note

note bottom of RequestHandlers
  Die Handler verwenden nicht mehr das alte
  DeviceManagement-Routing, sondern den
  IDeviceIntegrationService-SmartProxy.

  Sie übersetzen zwischen bestehenden
  WebAPI-Modellen und neuen Plugin-DTOs.
end note

note bottom of DeviceIntegrationService
  GetDevices liest direkt aus dem Catalog.

  Gerätebezogene Methoden prüfen das Device
  im Catalog und rufen die JobFacade gezielt
  mit request.DeviceId.Service auf.
end note

@enduml